CIVICSYNC — COMPLETE WEBSITE REDESIGN AND FUNCTIONALITY IMPROVEMENT
1. YOUR ROLE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, UI/UX designer, frontend architect, backend engineer, database engineer, authentication specialist, and software tester.

You are working on an existing project called CivicSync.

Your task is to inspect, improve, redesign, and complete the existing application.

Do not simply create a new landing page or a collection of attractive dashboard mockups. Implement a cohesive, responsive, fully functional web application with working navigation, role-specific authentication, separate dashboards, persistent data, and proper access control.

Preserve existing working functionality wherever possible.

Repair broken functionality before introducing unnecessary replacements.

