FINAL OBJECTIVE

Deliver a polished, functional CivicSync website with this exact primary order:

Landing Page → Separate Login Portal → Role-Specific Login → Role-Specific Dashboard → Individual Feature Pages → Explicit Sign Out → Landing Page.

The landing page must have a new visual identity.

